{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">香港小姐2026｜《2026香港小姐競選》湖南外景酒店房突擊行動繼續進行！今次由師姐馮盈盈出馬，負責「搜查」6號盧蔚晴（Jasmine）與12號湯家琳（Caris）的房間。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">馮盈盈一開門就發揮偵探本色，立刻鎖定近門口處一對單獨亂放的白色鞋。Jasmine見狀隨即爆笑開啟「媽咪模式」，套用網絡潮文對着Caris訓話：「Jayden，你點解咁樣㗎？媽咪講過，唔可以咁樣呀嘛，你同我即刻擺返好佢！」場面十分搞笑。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"5988db4c-fd6f-4b3b-989e-844c0b8f72e1.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026C9Qqh8bRxR1784024175.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"5988db4c-fd6f-4b3b-989e-844c0b8f72e1.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">隨後進入萬眾期待的行李開箱環節。Caris的行李箱出乎意料地整齊，各類物品均用上專屬的包裝袋妥善分類分隔。當馮盈盈問及她的MBTI時，Caris自爆其實是隨性隨心的「P人」，令馮盈盈大感驚訝並大讚：「P人suppose係random（隨機）啲喎，但個篋都好整齊，畀個like你，強迫症睇咗都話好！」</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">談到同房相處會否有磨擦，兩位佳麗大派定心丸表示完全沒有。她們透露作息時間配合得天衣無縫，Caris洗澡時Jasmine通常已在夢鄉，而Caris洗完後就會一邊敷面膜一邊睡覺。至於洗澡的先後次序，Jasmine笑言「我哋打交先」，其後認真解釋兩人會互相體諒，按每晚誰有重要事處理或比較疲累來決定，彼此非常體貼。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"6352d967-b200-4dce-a8ae-1a116bc9f078.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026QwaoiMAWeY1784024182.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"6352d967-b200-4dce-a8ae-1a116bc9f078.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">此外，兩人更大爆睡前必做的小習慣——上磅磅重！Caris踢爆Jasmine晚上如廁後會向自己「匯報」，Jasmine即解釋是為了「分享經驗」。馮盈盈好奇追問是什麼經驗，Caris隨即揭曉謎底，原來「通暢秘訣」竟是靠「煲電話粥」！她笑指前一晚剛好跟姐姐通電話，馮盈盈聽罷即發揮搞笑本色神回：「即係同人傾吓傾吓就會有感覺啦？」引得全場大笑。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-18T08:18:33.059488+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":678,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}